WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.130
If you are a founder about to become a parent,

2
00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:04.960
you really need to think about where

3
00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:06.280
that time is going to come from

4
00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:06.630
for parenting.

5
00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:09.000
There's probably things you do as

6
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.920
a founder you don't need to do.

7
00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:12.500
Like, the least amount of decisions

8
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:13.900
that can be blocked on you,

9
00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:15.140
or the least amount of, like,

10
00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:17.930
actual day-to-day work you can do, the better.

11
00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:21.430
Because that time will be needed for being a parent.

12
00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:22.620
Try to take yourself out of

13
00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:23.700
the job as much as you can,

14
00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:24.520
and try to be as much

15
00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:26.280
of a figurehead of a CEO

16
00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:27.800
or a figurehead of an executive,

17
00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:28.960
like, as much as you can,

18
00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:30.690
in the most positive way possible.

19
00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:33.140
And then if you have excess time, that's great.

20
00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:34.360
You can fill it with stuff.

21
00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:35.700
But most likely you're still

22
00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:36.760
going to be scrambling for time.

23
00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:38.030
But that time to parent and

24
00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:39.260
that time to support your spouse

25
00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:40.850
has to come from somewhere.
